                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "z1QFE",
                  "name": "Rules",
                  "fill": "#3A362F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Borders: 1px $line hairlines structure tables and sections; 1px $line-2 for interactive bounds. Elevation: surfaces stay flat — hierarchy comes from tone + hairlines; only drawers/sheets/overlays cast one shadow (0,8,24 #00000040).\n\nZ-index (fixed): 0 content · 10 sticky page header · 20 ballot rail / side workspace · 30 drawer & sheet · 40 command overlay · 50 toast.\n\nBreakpoints: ≥1280 desktop — 240px sidebar, content max 1152, optional 336px rail. 768–1279 tablet — 64px icon sidebar, rail becomes sheet, reduced columns. ≤767 mobile — compact top bar, decision cards, safe-area bottom summaries, 44px minimum targets.\n\nIcons: Lucide, 16/20px, 1.5px stroke; icon-only controls always carry accessible names.\n\nMotion: transform/opacity only · ≤200ms local feedback · easing out · state/spatial continuity only · no looping decoration · reduced-motion removes all non-essential animation. Ambient glow: one static radial $glow on the shell hero region only — never behind dense data, never animated, never a hierarchy device.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.6,
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
