      "name": "IA note — Gauges nav",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 220,
      "content": "Owner direction 2026-08-30: Gauges as a sidebar destination is redundant. Vote already lists every gauge; lock-level profile, incentives, transfer, and merge live on Overview lock actions. Keep existing Gauge detail / add-incentives frames as contextual routes from Vote cards and Overview locks. Do not design a Gauges directory. Sidebar still shows Gauges until a later nav cleanup so existing frames stay consistent.\n\nThis column: remaining Overview states (disconnected marketplace, no locks, watching, wrong network). Vote validators + pools go under the Vote column. Light screens continue to match the current mockup (hardcoded #FFFFFF / Figtree / orange-pink locks)."
    },
